      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kael Drakkel, The King's Madness [zone=869]\n**Who:**\n- Bjorik the Heartstrong [npc=41308]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a fey delerium [npc=41670]\n- a fey uniter [npc=41671]\n- a penumbral coldain [npc=41685]\n- an umbral coldain [npc=41733]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:37:16 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Bjorik the Heartstrong ( map) in Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness. He's located at -40, 1545, -195 (just north of the bank in the city center)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Bjorik the Heartstrong'\nBjorik the Heartstrong says 'Keep away from me, you blood-sucking leech! I've seen what your kind is [capable] of.'\nYou say, 'Capable?'\nBjorik the Heartstrong says 'Each night I see the same dream: all is calm as I guard the Shrine, when suddenly, the arena is flooded by hundreds of tiny figures! The shrill sound of battle rings in my ears, as they strike down the mighty Derakor. Then one - just like you! - turns towards me and shrieks to the rest, \"[Clear the trash]!\"'\nYou say, 'Clear the trash?'\nBjorik the Heartstrong passes a hand over his eyes wearily, 'And now, it is all too real. Once-mighty Kromzek lie strewn upon the floor, while their tiny slayers roam these great halls laying ruin... And you, tiny one; you are [one of them]! Tell me one reason I should not slay you right here, and avenge their memories!'\nYou say, 'I'm not one of them!'\nBjorik the Heartstrong says 'Do you deny it?! Are our halls not littered with the bodies of those slain by the murderous Coldain, who thirst only for the blood of my kind?! If you would prove yourself other than they; go forth, and rid us of this blight! Only then will I stay my hand when next our paths cross.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Taking Out the Trash'.\nBjorik has challenged you to prove you're not allied with the invaders, by slaying them.\n\n---\n\nKill 8 Coldain or Faeries 0/8 (Kael Drakkel)\nReturn to Bjorik 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
