      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kael Drakkel, The King's Madness [zone=869]\n**Who:**\n- Faffnar Wolfsbane [npc=41309]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a twisted prowler [npc=41702]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:37:29 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Faffnar Wolfsbane ( map) in Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness. He's located at -55, -215, 35 (a little ways from the zone-in)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Faffnar Wolfsbane'\nFaffnar Wolfsbane says 'No! Do not harm me, I beg of you! If you spare me, I may be of [service] to you.'\nYou say, 'Service?'\nFaffnar Wolfsbane says 'You are truly benevolent to spare my life, so I shall tell you: even as we speak, you are being hunted. The prowlers, have a keen sense of smell, and have no doubt noticed your presence from the moment you entered this place. There is only one way to [survive].'\nYou say, 'Survive?'\nFaffnar Wolfsbane says 'You must slay them first, or they will undoubtedly be your undoing; just as they have been for many of my kin.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Paranoia - It's Out to Get You!'.\nFaffnar has told you of the prowlers' warped nature. If you wish to survive, you must hunt them down, before they find you!\n\n---\n\nKill 7 prowlers 0/7 (Kael Drakkel)\nReturn to Faffnar 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
