      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kael Drakkel, The King's Madness [zone=869]\n**Who:**\n- Baffod the Wayward [npc=41310]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:37:48 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with Baffod the Wayward ( map) in Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness. He's located at 50, 1460, -175 (north of the bank in the city center)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Baffod the Wayward'\nBaffod the Wayward says 'Ach! 'Tis good to see a fellow adventurer amidst all this [madness]! I was beginnin' ta think I might be the only sane person left in all of Norrath!'\nYou say, 'What madness?'\nBaffod the Wayward says 'Aye. I'm not sure what's goin' on, exactly, but it looks like trouble ta me. I wouldn'a stick aroun' if I were yeh. I certainly don't plan to [much longer].'\nYou say, 'Much longer?'\nBaffod the Wayward says 'Well, it's not exactly easy, sneakin' through a hall full o' angry giants. It takes time. One foot wrong and yeh'll be flat enough ta sell as parchment fer spell research! It'd be easier if there weren't quite so many o' the big lugs stompin' around. I dun'nae s'pose yeh'd mind [help]in'?'\nYou say, 'I will help'\nBaffod the Wayward says 'Yer the bes' friend a dwarf ever had in a hall full o' ravin' mad giants. And I'm not jus' sayin' tha'. Thanks fer yer help!'\nYou have been assigned the task 'One Step Forward, Two Steps Back'.\nBaffod has asked you to help by cutting down the number of giants in the area.\n\n---\n\nKill 9 Kromzek or Kromrif 0/9 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Note: If you want to avoid faction hits here, you can kill the couriers that roam about the zone (they are factionless)._\nReturn to Baffod 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
