      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kael Drakkel, The King's Madness [zone=869]\n**Who:**\n- Kvojik [npc=41312]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a cruel wurmling [npc=41663]\n- a daemonic lorespawn [npc=41664]\n- a fading dirge [npc=41669]\n- a fey delerium [npc=41670]\n- a fey uniter [npc=41671]\n- a penumbral coldain [npc=41685]\n- a twisted prowler [npc=41702]\n- an extinct kedge [npc=41732]\n- an umbral coldain [npc=41733]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:38:21 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task begins with Kvojik ( map) in Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness. He's located at -425, 2340, -295 (across from the Wakening Land zone on the western side of Kael)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Kvojik'\nKvojik glances at you, raising his brow in surprise, 'Oh, I see. You wish to challenge me. Very well, little one, I shall give you the honor of dying in battle, although I must disappoint your hopes of a noble death, for you are not [worthy] of my blade!'\nYou say, 'I am worthy!'\nKvojik says 'You surprise me, little one, for I thought I had slain you in a single stroke! Clearly, you are neither so weak, nor so pitiful as you appear. It is well then, that I did not use my axe, for I can see now that you have a great strength of heart - a trait which I respect above all others. It is for this [reason] that I have yet to enter the battle which my kinsmen so desperately fight.'\nYou say, 'What reason?'\nKvojik says 'I have sworn that my axe, Steel Singer, shall never taste the blood of weaklings, for to bathe it in the blood of the weak-hearted may weaken its strength; I shall only raise my weapon against those who I deem worthy to whet Steel Singer's blade - and I fear that these invaders may not be. Oh! If only I knew how to measure the strength of their [hearts]!'\nYou say, 'Hearts?'\nKvojik says 'That's it - of course! When you are rested, go and collect the hearts of some of these invaders. I shall compare them to see which of them - if any - may be worthy opponents for my Steel Singer.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Weight of a Worthy Heart'.\nKvojik has asked you to bring him the hearts of his foes, that he may measure their worth as opponents.\n\n---\n\nThis is a solo task. No need to loot anything, just kill 1 of each mob type and your whole group (if you're grouped) gets the update.\n1\\. Collect one heart from a drake 0/1 (Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness)\n2\\. Collect one heart from a wormling 0/1 (Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness)\n3\\. Collect one heart from a faerie 0/1 (Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness)\n4\\. Collect one heart from a Coldain 0/1 (Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness)\n5\\. Collect one heart from a Kedge 0/1 (Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness)\n6\\. Collect one heart from a prowler 0/1 (Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness)\n7\\. Collect one heart from a Daemonic Lorespawn 0/1 (Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness)\n8\\. Return to Kvojik 0/1 (Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness)\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experience!",
