      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kael Drakkel, The King's Madness [zone=869]\n**Who:**\n- Nojas Blackfist [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Flask of Kromrif Ale [item=106467]\n- Kromrif Ale Barrel [item=108346]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bjoskhua Blackfist [npc=41741]\n- Merc McFader [npc=41855]\n- a barrel of ale [npc=41659]\n- a drunken faerie [npc=41668]\n- a hammered mercenary [npc=42652]\n- a ritualist of Rallos Zek [npc=41692]\n- a ritualist of Tallon Zek [npc=41690]\n- a ritualist of Vallon Zek [npc=41691]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:38:48 2012\nModified: Mon Jan 13 02:16:55 2025 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\nThis task begins with Nojas Blackfist [npc=41314] ( map) in Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness [zone=869]. He is found at /location -630, 1045, -125 (southern part of the zone: in the north room adjacent to the Iceshard Manor's main room).\nPre-Requisites:\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\n\n---\n\n1\\. Speak to Nojas Blackfist and find out how you can assist the militia 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n2\\. Speak to Bjoskhua Blackfist and see how you can compel the mercenaries to fight 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\nBjoskhua Blackfist [npc=41741] ( map) is found in the room to the south.\n3\\. Kill the drunken faeries hovering around the ale barrels 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\nClear the drunken faeries [npc=41668] away from a barrel of ale [npc=41659] ( map) and then click on the barrel to receive a Kromrif Ale Barrel [item=108346]. A barrel is found outside the bank (central part of the zone) and in the area near the Wakening Land (far western part of the zone).\n4\\. Pick up a barrel of ale and deliver it to Merc McFader 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\nGive the Kromrif Ale Barrel to Merc McFader [npc=41855] ( map) in Iceshard Manor.\n5\\. Tell Nojas that you have convinced the mercenaries to fight 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n6\\. Tell Merc McFader that you are ready to fight 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\nHail Merc McFader. You receive a Flask of Kromrif Ale [item=106467] and are asked if you want to use a mercenary pet for this fight.\n7\\. Kill a ritualist of Tallon Zek 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n8\\. Kill a ritualist of Vallon Zek 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n9\\. Kill a ritualist of Rallos Zek 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\na ritualist of Tallon Zek [npc=41690] ( map) spawns in the rooms connected to the arena (northeast of the arena in Gkrean Prophet of Tallon [npc=41175]'s room).\na ritualist of Vallon Zek [npc=41691] ( map) spawns in the rooms connected to the arena (northwest of the arena in Semkak Prophet of Vallon [npc=41182]'s room).\na ritualist of Rallos Zek [npc=41692] ( map) spawns in the very northern part of the zone, by The Statue of Rallos Zek [npc=41186]'s room (around 2450, 1390, -36).\nNOTE: The ritualist of Rallos Zek summons from 100% health (the other two may as well, but this particular one is the only one reported.)\nTarget your pet mercenary and use the Flask of Kromrif Ale [item=106467] on it to increase its drunken state (which also increases its damage output). Keep clicking it until it's at a point where it's proccing a spell. This spell damages the shielding of the ritualists you need to kill. Five procs on a ritualist will eliminate its shield. The mercenary must keep attacking at full power, otherwise the ritualists can regenerate.\n10\\. Inform Merc McFader of the results of your battle 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n11\\. Tell Nojas Blackfist that you succeeded in stopping the ritualists 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nPlatinum\nExperience",
