      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kael Drakkel, The King's Madness [zone=869]\n**Who:**\n- Kiltar [npc=41316]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Jainar's Sword [item=106418]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Bjoskhua Blackfist [npc=41741]\n- Egarik [npc=41757]\n- Jainar [npc=41812]\n- Nojas Blackfist [ _Quest_]\n- Yngvie [npc=42096]\n- a daemonic lorespawn [npc=41664]\n- a fey delerium [npc=41670]\n- a fey uniter pet [npc=41867]\n- a mysterious shadow [npc=44018]\n- a penumbral coldain [npc=41685]\n- an extinct kedge [npc=41732]\n- an umbral coldain [npc=41733]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Wed Nov 28 21:39:26 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with Kiltar ( map) in Kael Drakkel: The King's Madness. He is found at the zone-in (-15, -615)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Kiltar'\nKiltar says 'Greetings, little thing. You have entered into the great city of Kael Drakkel, home of the Kromzek as well as a few of my kind, the Kromrif. If you are to walk among my people as a peer, you must [prove yourself] as a friend, not a foe.'\nYou say, 'Prove myself?'\nKiltar says 'Strange happenings are afoot and if you could help me [investigate], I would be most thankful. I have been ordered by King Tormax himself not to leave my post, or else I would look into these matters myself.'\nYou say, 'I will investigate'\nKiltar says 'Though the relationship between the Kromzek and Kromrif is not without tension at times, we have worked together to secure a home for ourselves. Our chief concern has been the coldain, but lately something strange and far more [sinister] is threatening our city.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Madness Reigns'.\nKael Drakkel is in the midst of a spreading madness. Kiltar has asked you to speak with some of his friends so you can perhaps learn more about what is going on within the city.\nYou say, 'Something sinister?'\nKiltar says 'Our king has gone mad and the majority of our citizens are hallucinating, claiming they see visions of terrible creatures. The whole city is on the brink of a civil war. My own friends have even fallen victim to this mysterious plague. Why I haven't fallen victim to this same madness, I do not know. I would ask that you visit some of my friends and try to learn more about what is [going on].'\nYou say, 'What's going on?'\nKiltar says 'If the coldain are behind this, they will surely pay with their lives. I need to have proof however before anything further can be done.'\n\n---\n\n_Note: The task locks upon the first hail._\nSpeak with Egarik 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Egarik ( map) is found at /location -600, 1200, -115 (near the entrance to Iceshard Manor in the southern part of the zone)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Egarik'\nEgarik says 'The coldain are attacking! I don't know how they infiltrated our city, but they have! Kill any coldain you see and defend the city!'\nKill some Penumbral Coldain or Umbral Coldain 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_These can be found in the city center and in the area leading towards the throne room in the south._\nSpeak with Bjoskhua Blackfist 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Bjoskhua Blackfist ( map) is found at /location -1060, 1000, -125 (the southern-most room of Iceshard Manor in the southern part of the zone)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Bjoskhua Blackfist'\nBjoskhua Blackfist says 'I told the king this would happen but he wouldn't listen to me! The kedge have snuck into the city's long-forgotten waterways! I took one of the slimy bastards out just yesterday! They are a threat to our very existence! You must destroy as many of them as you can!'\nKill some Extinct Kedge 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_These can be found in the water next to the ice pit that's found just north of the throne area (southern part of the zone)._\nSpeak with Nojas Blackfist 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Nojas Blackfist ( map) is found at /location -630, 1045, -125 (the northern room of Iceshard Manor; due north of the previous hail update)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Nojas Blackfist'\nNojas Blackfist says 'Revolting creatures! Fey have somehow gotten past our slacking guards and have entered the city! This invasion must be stopped! Kill any Fey you come across for the glory of Kael Drakkel!'\nKill some Fey Deleriums or Fey Uniters 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\nSpeak with Yngvie 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Yngvie ( map) is found at /location 100, 1200, -135. If coming from the Eastern Wastes, pass through the first archway, keep going, pass through the second archway, and hang an immediate right (north). He is outside one of the buildings in this area._\nYou say, 'Hail, Yngvie'\nYngvie says 'Have you seen them? The mephits! They're everywhere! You must destroy them before they infiltrate the king's chambers!'\nKill some Daemonic Lorespawns 0/4 (Kael Drakkel)\n_These are the mephit apparition mobs that are found in and around the center of the zone._\nSpeak with Kiltar 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\nKill Jainar 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Jainar ( map) is found at /location 120, 900, -135 (just east of Yngvie's location)._\n_\"a mysterious shadow\" spawns once you kill Jainar._\na mysterious shadow leaps out of Jainar's corpse. 'What a shame. I will just have to find another clumsy body to inhabit.'\nLoot Jainar's Sword 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\nGive Jainar's Sword to Kiltar 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\nSpeak with Kiltar 0/1 (Kael Drakkel)\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience (3 AAs)",
