      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Kael Drakkel [ToV]\n**Who:**\n- Derakor the Vindicator - ToV [ _Quest_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Adjutant Gelbenden - ToV [npc=55194]\n- Adjutant Hoggren - ToV [npc=55633]\n- Kael militia captain - ToV [npc=55237]\n- Legionnaire Evbarjor [npc=55244]\n- Legionnaire Whiteaxe - ToV [npc=55476]\n- Sentinel Bjhern [npc=55467]\n- Sentinel Crrlarn [npc=55274]\n- Sentinel Dekrendar [npc=55411]\n- Sentinel Fyjrael [npc=55278]\n- Sentinel Lergremor [npc=55280]\n- Sentinel Mjrakkor [npc=55282]\n- Sentinel Nellenar - ToV [npc=55607]\n- Sentinel Thunderfist [npc=55401]\n- Sergeant Squallsounder [npc=55294]\n- Trooper Derheim [npc=55304]\n- Trooper Dlemdimor [npc=55305]\n- Trooper Jhonev [npc=55306]\n- Veteran Mjrlind [npc=55316]\n- a storm giant soldier - ToV [npc=55189]\n- protector of Zek [npc=55374]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Citizens Revolting [quest=9758]\n- Mercenary of Kael Drakkel (10 Points) [quest=9803]\n**Era:** | !Torment of Velious\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 3 22:08:59 2019\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Torment of Velious Info & Guides: Overview \\| Progression & Task List \\| Raiding \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n**Prerequisite Quest(s):** Citizens Revolting\nThis is the second solo task given by Derakor the Vindicator.\nSay \"skills\" to get this task.\nDerakor has taken it upon himself to defend the king and stand in the way of the horde of restless dead. However, he shares the Kromrif and Kromzek reverence for their dead and finds it very distateful to hack them up. So, he has asked you to return some of the restless dead citizens of Kael to their proper state of just plain dead.\n\n---\n\n1\\. The restless giant soldiers must be destroyed 0/14 (Kael Drakkel)\nKill any restless soldier in Kael. This notably includes a storm giant soldier [npc=55189] as well as any named Adjutant, Legionnaire, Sentinel, Trooper, Veteran, Watcher ...\nThese update quest:\n<\\-\\-\\- related npcs are what updates this step\nThis DO NOT update the quest:\nOracle Bloodstorm\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n283 platinum 3 gold 3 silver 3 copper\n**Submitted by:** Cylius & Laurana\n- 283 platinum 3 gold 3 silver 3 copper",
